      "content": "ESLint, Prettier, and Tailwind Setup"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Three more tools were configured before the first Claude Code prompt: ESLint, Prettier, and Tailwind CSS."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "ESLint catches code quality issues - unused variables, missing dependencies in React hooks, unsafe type assertions. Running ESLint after each chunk is part of the verification checklist."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Prettier enforces consistent formatting. When Claude Code generates code, it may use 2-space or 4-space indentation depending on context. Prettier normalizes everything automatically on save."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Tailwind CSS was installed and configured with the custom token set from Chapter 3:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "react",
      "content": "yarn add -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer npx tailwindcss init -p"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The tailwind.config.ts then received the full design token extension from the brand guidelines. This was the last manual setup step before Chunk 1 ran."
    },
